    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.files\n\n### Question\n\nI think that using `:write` to synchronize the edits would provide a more \"native\" experience to mini.files. Is that doable?",
